# Spezifische Ausschlüsse (Configs, Cache, etc.)
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/installer_config.json
**/e3dc.config.txt
**/e3dc.wallbox.txt
**/e3dc_v4.json
**/live_data_py.json
**/output.json
**/*.log
**/*.backup
**/*.bak
/backups/
